1
00:00:00,523 --> 00:00:05,563
An empty screen. We open the GlattTrack app on the team leader's tablet.

2
00:00:07,265 --> 00:00:13,763
The app connects to the plant server. The server has no team leader yet, so this is the first installation.

3
00:00:15,012 --> 00:00:20,794
Fill in the team leader's name, a personal code, and the server setup code from the installer.

4
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:30,825
The server checks the setup code and approves the installation.

5
00:00:36,329 --> 00:00:43,215
This tablet is now registered as the team leader's device. The setup page opens, only this once.

6
00:00:44,744 --> 00:00:49,146
A recovery code. It can be skipped and made later.

7
00:00:50,937 --> 00:00:59,213
Choose the screens the plant uses: slaughter, esophagus, legs and head, inner, outer, small parts, and stamps. Then save.

8
00:01:11,852 --> 00:01:17,098
Workers, pairing the tablets, the owner and the printers can be done now or later.

9
00:01:19,909 --> 00:01:25,576
The team leader screen is open. Now, a working day, station by station.

10
00:01:29,929 --> 00:01:36,520
The slaughter tablet. The shochet presses one button per animal, and the next number fills in by itself.

11
00:01:44,757 --> 00:01:47,757
Animal five: nevela.

12
00:01:51,075 --> 00:01:56,150
Tapping a marked number opens a correction, only before the next station has touched it.

13
00:02:04,396 --> 00:02:07,396
The esophagus check tablet.

14
00:02:08,973 --> 00:02:13,156
Trying to skip to animal three. The system does not allow it.

15
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:19,268
Tap the blinking animal and choose OK.

16
00:02:44,733 --> 00:02:49,889
The legs and head tablet. Stickers are printed right after slaughter, before the ruling.

17
00:02:49,889 --> 00:02:53,072
The first tap prints the leg stickers.

18
00:02:55,306 --> 00:03:01,661
The legs sticker. Printed: the number, the Hebrew and Gregorian dates, and the time. In the QR code: everything.

19
00:03:01,661 --> 00:03:04,728
The second tap prints the head sticker.

20
00:03:06,919 --> 00:03:09,997
The head sticker has the same details.

21
00:03:11,753 --> 00:03:16,364
Every animal in order. A nevela also gets a number sticker.

22
00:03:43,650 --> 00:03:46,650
The nevela sticker.

23
00:04:01,543 --> 00:04:05,735
The inner inspector's tablet. Tap the next animal in line.

24
00:04:07,097 --> 00:04:10,097
Rumen check: kosher.

25
00:04:11,032 --> 00:04:14,032
Maw: kosher.

26
00:04:14,798 --> 00:04:17,798
The lung drawing: mark it with a finger.

27
00:04:22,329 --> 00:04:26,975
Approve for the outer inspector. The animal moves on with its drawing.

28
00:04:38,777 --> 00:04:43,817
Animal three is treif. The first tap asks, the second tap rules.

29
00:04:52,326 --> 00:04:56,371
Animals two, four and six: kosher, and approve.

30
00:05:23,020 --> 00:05:28,450
The outer inspector's tablet. The lung drawing is shown, and the inspector rules.

31
00:05:31,366 --> 00:05:34,366
Animal one: Glatt.

32
00:05:35,403 --> 00:05:40,705
Animal two: Beit Yosef. Animal four: Glatt. Animal six: kosher.

33
00:05:53,366 --> 00:05:57,415
The ruling is made. Back to the legs tablet, for sorting.

34
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:10,839
Leg sorting: scan the sticker that was printed before the ruling.

35
00:06:12,324 --> 00:06:17,036
The number is updated: the screen shows the current ruling from the server.

36
00:06:22,666 --> 00:06:25,666
Leg three: treif, in red.

37
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:35,503
The small parts tablet: cheeks and tongue.

38
00:06:35,503 --> 00:06:39,533
Animal three is treif. The screen refuses to print.

39
00:06:42,273 --> 00:06:47,717
Animal one: one tap prints three stickers: cheek one, cheek two, and tongue.

40
00:06:50,626 --> 00:06:56,661
The parts sticker: the ruling in Hebrew and English, and the kashrut mark. In this film, a sample mark.

41
00:06:56,661 --> 00:06:59,661
Animal two: Beit Yosef.

42
00:07:01,997 --> 00:07:05,249
Beit Yosef, with its own kashrut mark.

43
00:07:14,849 --> 00:07:17,949
The stamps and weighing tablet, for the main carcass.

44
00:07:17,949 --> 00:07:22,653
Scan the animal's sticker. Five stamps print, by the ruling.

45
00:07:27,177 --> 00:07:31,308
The stamp of animal one, by its ruling, with the kashrut mark.

46
00:07:31,988 --> 00:07:36,462
Weighing: scan the weight label, right side and then left side.

47
00:07:41,884 --> 00:07:45,705
Animal one is stamped and weighed. On to the next.

48
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:58,872
Back with the team leader: the card of animal one, with its whole history.

49
00:07:59,879 --> 00:08:03,988
Every action: who, when, and from which tablet.

50
00:08:04,105 --> 00:08:06,292
Sample stickers, every kind.

51
00:08:06,292 --> 00:08:13,320
Top row: legs and head, before the ruling. Bottom row: parts and stamps, after the ruling, with the kashrut mark.
